# Collab: working-tree paths that must NEVER acquire a collaborative lock.
#
# One glob pattern (fnmatch) per line; matched against the project-relative
# POSIX path AND the basename. A trailing "/" matches a directory prefix; a
# trailing "/**" matches anything beneath a directory. Blank lines and lines
# starting with "#" are ignored.
#
# Built-in temp suffixes (*.tmp, *.temp, *.bak, *.backup, *.orig, *.swp, *.swo,
# *~, *.isorted) and VCS/instance folders are always ignored without listing
# them here. Add project-specific transient/scratch files below.

# Transient diagnostic / simulation scratch files created during development
.sim_*
.tmp_*

# Temporary issue/PR body drafts written by tooling before submission
.issue_body_temp.md
*_temp.md
